# Pets & People CareBridge: Architecture Overview

The CareBridge ecosystem is a dual-service platform connecting pet owners with verified caretakers and adoption hubs. The current architecture is in a transitionary phase, moving from a Firebase-centric model to a hardened self-hosted backend.

